aiDraft.prompt:
Write a professional post-incident report (postmortem) with these details:

Title: {incident_title}
Severity: {severity}
Duration: {duration}
Affected: {affected}
What happened: {what_happened}
Detection: {detection}
Resolution: {resolution}
Root cause: {root_cause}

Sections to include:
1. Summary
2. Impact
3. Timeline (reconstruct from the details above, use approximate times if needed)
4. Root Cause Analysis
5. What Went Well
6. What Could Be Improved
7. Action Items (use [Owner TBD] and [Due TBD] as placeholders)

Tone: factual, blameless, constructive.

finalReport.prompt:
Update this incident report with the following notes. Incorporate any owners, dates, or corrections provided. If notes are empty, return the report unchanged.

Notes: {review_notes}

Report:
{report}
